      "source_tier": 1,
      "title": "Koseki Bijou (1st costume)",
      "excerpt": "The default costume of [[hololive english|hololive EN]]'s [[Koseki Bijou]]. \r\n\r\nHer default costume consists of a floating gemstone [[circlet]]/[[headpiece]], a [[detached collar]] a [[medium dress|knee-length]] [[white dress|white]] [[strapless dress|strapless]] [[pleated dress]] an [[underbust]] [[black corset]] with an attached [[waist cape]] with [[coattails]], a [[white skirt|white]] [[overskirt]], a [[white sleeves|white]] [[single detached sleeve]] on one arm and an [[arm garter]] with an [[armlet]] on the other. As mentioned above, her feet are encased in [[purple gem]], giving the impression of [[purple boots|purple]] [[ankle boots]].\r\n\r\nFor her default hairstyle, she has [[very long hair|very long]] [[grey hair]] with [[pink hair|pink]] [[colored inner hair]] with [[hair flaps]].\r\n\r\nh4. Appearance\r\n\r\n* !post #6528021: Profile\r\n* !post #6540704: Reference sheet",
      "captured_at": "2026-08-31"
    },
